    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 Can you handle the Genre-Bending Action?</strong> Take everything you know about Dot collecting games, then add Timed Puzzles, Obstacles, Enemy Types &amp; Score Multipliers <strong>!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate to avoid Enemies &amp; Obstacles as you try to collect enough energy to help 'RoLL' escape. Learn the <strong>Twitch Control scheme</strong> to master the '<strong><u>Drift &amp; Snap</u></strong>' and '<strong><u>Score Bank </u></strong>' gameplay systems. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add yourself to the <strong>HighScore</strong> ladder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>PowerUps</strong> to smash Enemies, dash out of danger &amp; even blow up destructable walls that reveal hidden areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Clock is ticking</u></strong> survive long enough to reach each of the <strong><u>4 score multipliers</u></strong>. Faster clear times = a bigger Score Bonus!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save this little Guy <strong>! ! !</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 Can you handle the Genre-Bending Action?</strong> Take everything you know about Dot collecting games, then add Timed Puzzles, Obstacles, Enemy Types &amp; Score Multipliers <strong>!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate to avoid Enemies &amp; Obstacles as you try to collect enough energy to help 'RoLL' escape. Learn the <strong>Twitch Control scheme</strong> to master the '<strong><u>Drift &amp; Snap</u></strong>' and '<strong><u>Score Bank </u></strong>' gameplay systems. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add yourself to the <strong>HighScore</strong> ladder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>PowerUps</strong> to smash Enemies, dash out of danger &amp; even blow up destructable walls that reveal hidden areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Clock is ticking</u></strong> survive long enough to reach each of the <strong><u>4 score multipliers</u></strong>. Faster clear times = a bigger Score Bonus!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save this little Guy <strong>! ! !</strong></p>",
